WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:00.731 --> 00:02.466 align:center line:81%
With love unfeigned,

00:03.500 --> 00:04.635 align:center line:81%
we all echo

00:05.802 --> 00:11.875 align:center line:79%
President Oaks’ tribute to the passing
of President Russell M. Nelson.

00:13.477 --> 00:20.517 align:center line:79%
And with equal love and deep mourning,
we all acknowledge the tragedies

00:21.818 --> 00:23.820 align:center line:81%
in Michigan recently and

00:25.088 --> 00:27.558 align:center line:81%
almost daily all around the world.

00:29.426 --> 00:33.463 align:center line:79%
We acknowledge these things
with love and affection

00:33.897 --> 00:37.067 align:center line:81%
and trust in the Lord Jesus Christ.

00:39.836 --> 00:45.542 align:center line:79%
The ninth chapter of John
records the experience of Jesus

00:46.043 --> 00:52.583 align:center line:79%
and His disciples passing
near a beggar, blind from birth.

00:54.017 --> 00:55.619 align:center line:81%
This led the disciples

00:55.619 --> 01:03.527 align:center line:79%
to ask Jesus several complex
religious questions regarding the origin

01:03.527 --> 01:07.197 align:center line:81%
and transmission of this man's limitation.

01:09.866 --> 01:17.774 align:center line:79%
The Master responded by doing
something very simple and very surprising.

01:17.774 --> 01:19.509 align:center line:81%
He spit into the dirt

01:21.311 --> 01:24.414 align:center line:81%
and stirred a small mixture of clay.

01:26.149 --> 01:30.153 align:center line:79%
He then applied
this to the eyes of the man,

01:31.388 --> 01:36.059 align:center line:79%
instructing him
to wash in the Pool of Siloam.

01:37.461 --> 01:38.462 align:center line:81%
All this

01:39.763 --> 01:43.467 align:center line:79%
the sightless
man obediently did,

01:44.601 --> 01:45.602 align:center line:81%
and

01:45.602 --> 01:50.007 align:center line:81%
“came [forth] seeing,”

01:51.341 --> 01:52.576 align:center line:81%
the scripture says.

01:57.247 --> 01:59.983 align:center line:81%
How important evidence is

02:02.819 --> 02:05.656 align:center line:81%
opposed to wishes,

02:06.790 --> 02:10.894 align:center line:81%
or argument, or even malice,

02:11.928 --> 02:14.564 align:center line:81%
in opposition to the truth.

02:17.901 --> 02:23.774 align:center line:79%
Well, afraid this miracle would again
add to the threat Jesus already posed

02:24.007 --> 02:25.809 align:center line:81%
to his presumed authority,

02:26.943 --> 02:34.351 align:center line:79%
the enemies of the Savior confronted
the newly sighted man and said in anger,

02:35.185 --> 02:38.755 align:center line:81%
“We know [Jesus] is a sinner.”

02:41.091 --> 02:44.628 align:center line:79%
The man listened
for a moment and then said,

02:45.796 --> 02:50.834 align:center line:81%
“Whether he be a sinner, ... I know not:

02:51.835 --> 02:53.970 align:center line:81%
[but] one thing I [do] know, ...

02:55.706 --> 03:00.143 align:center line:81%
whereas I was blind, now I see.”

03:02.579 --> 03:03.880 align:center line:81%
How grateful we are

03:05.248 --> 03:10.620 align:center line:79%
for evidence to sustain
our declarations of truth.

03:12.856 --> 03:17.160 align:center line:79%
Jesus gave the first meaning
to this exchange,

03:18.462 --> 03:22.165 align:center line:79%
telling His disciples that all
of this had happened

03:22.566 --> 03:27.571 align:center line:79%
that “the works of God
should be made manifest.”

03:28.839 --> 03:33.376 align:center line:81%
Now remember that twice in this narrative,

03:34.544 --> 03:42.886 align:center line:79%
the Savior’s action was referred to
as “anointing” the blind man’s eyes,

03:44.521 --> 03:48.625 align:center line:81%
an act to be completed by washing.

03:50.627 --> 03:55.499 align:center line:79%
This description of “the works
of God [being] made manifest”

03:56.633 --> 04:02.405 align:center line:79%
could possibly suggest
the unfolding of an ordinance.

04:04.975 --> 04:13.083 align:center line:79%
Now, another truth that is evident
here are the instruments the Creator

04:13.083 --> 04:17.120 align:center line:79%
of heaven and earth
and all that in them are,

04:18.255 --> 04:21.591 align:center line:81%
all that he used to provide this miracle

04:23.026 --> 04:24.161 align:center line:81%
was spit

04:26.196 --> 04:27.764 align:center line:81%
and a handful of dirt!

04:29.566 --> 04:33.603 align:center line:81%
These very unlikely ingredients

04:34.671 --> 04:42.913 align:center line:79%
declare that God can bless us
by whatever method he chooses.

04:44.781 --> 04:48.552 align:center line:79%
Now, like Naaman
resisting the River Jordan

04:49.786 --> 04:55.225 align:center line:79%
or the children of Israel refusing
to look at the serpent on the staff,

04:56.326 --> 04:58.795 align:center line:81%
how easy it is

04:59.863 --> 05:04.367 align:center line:79%
for us to dismiss the source
of our redemption

05:06.269 --> 05:09.806 align:center line:79%
because the ingredients
and the instruments

05:11.474 --> 05:14.644 align:center line:81%
seem embarrassingly plain.

05:16.913 --> 05:24.221 align:center line:79%
But we remember from the Book
of Mormon that some things are plain

05:25.222 --> 05:26.590 align:center line:81%
and precious,

05:28.391 --> 05:31.094 align:center line:81%
and that prior to Jesus’ birth,

05:32.095 --> 05:40.070 align:center line:79%
it would be prophesied that
“he [would have] no form nor comeliness;

05:40.737 --> 05:48.712 align:center line:79%
and when we [should] see him, there is no
beauty that we should desire him.”

05:50.146 --> 05:58.121 align:center line:79%
How often God has sent His majestic
message through a newly called

05:58.421 --> 06:02.125 align:center line:81%
and very anxious Relief Society president,

06:03.693 --> 06:08.899 align:center line:81%
or an unlearned boy on a New York farm,

06:10.367 --> 06:11.368 align:center line:81%
or a

06:12.235 --> 06:14.604 align:center line:81%
brand new missionary,

06:17.207 --> 06:18.208 align:center line:81%
or a baby

06:19.209 --> 06:21.811 align:center line:81%
lying in a manger.

06:23.480 --> 06:28.084 align:center line:81%
So what if the answers to our prayers

06:28.084 --> 06:34.090 align:center line:81%
come in plain or even convoluted ways?

06:36.092 --> 06:39.095 align:center line:81%
Are we willing to persevere

06:40.397 --> 06:44.000 align:center line:81%
to keep trying to live Christ’s gospel

06:45.101 --> 06:48.705 align:center line:81%
no matter how much spit and clay it takes?

06:51.274 --> 06:55.979 align:center line:79%
It may not always be clear
to us what is being done or why,

06:57.580 --> 07:05.221 align:center line:79%
and, from time to time, we will all
feel a little like the senior sister

07:05.922 --> 07:11.461 align:center line:79%
who said, “Lord, how about a blessing
that isn’t in disguise?”

07:14.064 --> 07:20.937 align:center line:79%
Consider the evidence of another truth,
this one regarding the holy priesthood.

07:22.238 --> 07:26.276 align:center line:79%
In documenting the organization
of the meridian Church,

07:26.876 --> 07:29.579 align:center line:81%
Luke’s first line reads:

07:30.880 --> 07:35.352 align:center line:79%
“Then he called his twelve
disciples together

07:35.852 --> 07:41.391 align:center line:81%
and gave them power and authority”—

07:43.426 --> 07:47.630 align:center line:81%
gifts not granted on the basis of

07:47.964 --> 07:54.037 align:center line:79%
impressive credentials
nor determined by tradition or birthright.

07:55.171 --> 08:01.544 align:center line:79%
They're not bestowed by a divinity
school or a theological seminary.

08:03.046 --> 08:09.285 align:center line:79%
They are conferred only
by the laying on of hands

08:10.687 --> 08:16.493 align:center line:79%
by one who has had authorized
hands laid on him

08:18.194 --> 08:26.269 align:center line:79%
in an unbroken sequence, back
to the source of all divine authority,

08:27.137 --> 08:29.939 align:center line:81%
the Lord Jesus Christ.

08:32.308 --> 08:36.646 align:center line:79%
And in a Church that understands
the gift of mercy,

08:37.981 --> 08:46.089 align:center line:79%
wouldn’t it be another marvelous evidence
of that Church’s truthfulness

08:47.557 --> 08:55.098 align:center line:79%
to see these blessings and covenants go
to our deceased kindred,

08:56.332 --> 09:02.739 align:center line:79%
those of our families who’ve gone
before us? Should they be penalized

09:04.007 --> 09:10.280 align:center line:79%
because they did not have access
to the gospel, or the laying on of hands,

09:10.280 --> 09:13.583 align:center line:81%
or because they were born at a time,

09:13.883 --> 09:19.889 align:center line:79%
or in a place when divine ordinances
and covenants were not available to them?

09:21.925 --> 09:28.731 align:center line:79%
The Church of Jesus Christ
of Latter-day Saints has sacred,

09:29.099 --> 09:32.802 align:center line:81%
dedicated houses of the Lord,

09:33.803 --> 09:43.246 align:center line:79%
in which merciful, salvific work is being
done vicariously every day and night

09:44.314 --> 09:46.182 align:center line:81%
for these deceased,

09:47.517 --> 09:54.057 align:center line:79%
as well as offering worship opportunities
and ordinances for the living.

09:55.825 --> 09:56.993 align:center line:81%
To my knowledge,

09:58.428 --> 10:02.599 align:center line:81%
this particular evidence of God's truth,

10:03.066 --> 10:08.204 align:center line:79%
His universal love
for the living and the dead,

10:09.305 --> 10:12.775 align:center line:81%
is not seen elsewhere in the world

10:14.444 --> 10:23.153 align:center line:79%
except in one Church that demonstrates
truth in this particular regard:

10:23.319 --> 10:27.123 align:center line:79%
The Church of Jesus Christ
of Latter-day Saints.

10:29.325 --> 10:31.461 align:center line:81%
Now, my first

10:32.562 --> 10:41.271 align:center line:79%
sight-giving, life-giving encounter
with real evidence of truth

10:42.305 --> 10:49.345 align:center line:79%
did not come with anointing
clay or in the Pool of Siloam.

10:50.713 --> 10:58.421 align:center line:79%
No, the instruments of truth
that brought my healing from the Lord

10:59.789 --> 11:03.426 align:center line:81%
came as pages in a book.

11:04.928 --> 11:10.333 align:center line:79%
Yes, the Book of Mormon:
Another Testament of Jesus Christ.

11:11.968 --> 11:15.505 align:center line:81%
I love books, and I've read books,

11:17.173 --> 11:21.544 align:center line:79%
and the claims about
this book have been attacked

11:21.544 --> 11:25.048 align:center line:81%
and dismissed by some unbelievers.

11:25.715 --> 11:26.950 align:center line:81%
The anger,

11:28.084 --> 11:31.788 align:center line:81%
often matching the vitriol of those

11:32.488 --> 11:38.828 align:center line:79%
who told the healed man that he could not
possibly have experienced

11:39.429 --> 11:43.600 align:center line:81%
what he knew he had experienced.

11:44.234 --> 11:45.768 align:center line:81%
“I was blind,

11:46.836 --> 11:48.504 align:center line:81%
and now I see.”

11:50.607 --> 11:51.608 align:center line:81%
That

11:52.175 --> 11:55.578 align:center line:81%
earlier criticism has been hurled at me—

11:57.247 --> 12:04.120 align:center line:79%
that the means by which this book
came were impractical, unbelievable,

12:05.021 --> 12:09.225 align:center line:81%
embarrassing, even unholy.

12:10.693 --> 12:15.765 align:center line:81%
Now, that's harsh language from anyone

12:16.933 --> 12:20.136 align:center line:81%
who presumes to know the means

12:21.337 --> 12:22.905 align:center line:81%
by which I know,

12:24.140 --> 12:26.876 align:center line:81%
and by which the book came to be.

12:27.477 --> 12:32.582 align:center line:79%
Inasmuch as the only
description given about those means

12:33.616 --> 12:35.585 align:center line:81%
is that it was translated

12:36.919 --> 12:41.291 align:center line:81%
“by the gift and power of ... God.”

12:41.291 --> 12:43.326 align:center line:81%
That’s it. That’s all.

12:44.827 --> 12:50.667 align:center line:79%
In any case, the impact
in my life of the Book

12:50.667 --> 12:58.241 align:center line:79%
of Mormon is no less miraculous
than was the application of spit

12:58.675 --> 13:03.513 align:center line:81%
and dirt placed on a blind man's eyes.

13:05.181 --> 13:06.716 align:center line:81%
It's been for me

13:07.750 --> 13:10.553 align:center line:81%
a rod of safety for my soul,

13:11.554 --> 13:19.562 align:center line:79%
a transcendent and penetrating light
of revelation and illumination

13:20.196 --> 13:23.232 align:center line:81%
of the path I must walk.

13:24.367 --> 13:27.403 align:center line:81%
When mists of darkness come,

13:27.670 --> 13:30.206 align:center line:81%
and surely they have.

13:32.241 --> 13:35.712 align:center line:81%
And surely they will.

13:38.181 --> 13:45.021 align:center line:79%
And given the view it’s granted
me of my Savior’s universal love

13:46.389 --> 13:48.524 align:center line:81%
and His redeeming grace,

13:50.126 --> 13:53.463 align:center line:81%
I share with you my witness,

13:54.464 --> 14:02.105 align:center line:79%
justified here as the newly
blessed man's parents said of their son

14:03.206 --> 14:06.676 align:center line:79%
that he should be heard
because he was “of age.”

14:07.810 --> 14:08.911 align:center line:81%
Well, so am I.

14:11.981 --> 14:16.052 align:center line:79%
He was old enough
to be taken seriously, they said.

14:16.753 --> 14:17.787 align:center line:81%
Well, so am I.

14:19.822 --> 14:24.260 align:center line:79%
I am two months away
from my 85th birthday.

14:25.461 --> 14:30.666 align:center line:81%
I have been on the edge of death and back.

14:32.135 --> 14:40.343 align:center line:79%
I’ve walked with kings and prophets,
with presidents and prophets and apostles.

14:41.677 --> 14:42.945 align:center line:81%
Best of all,

14:44.280 --> 14:52.321 align:center line:79%
at times I have been overwhelmed
by the holy Spirit of God.

14:53.689 --> 15:02.398 align:center line:79%
I trust that my witness should be given
at least some consideration here.

15:03.966 --> 15:05.535 align:center line:81%
Now, brothers and sisters,

15:06.936 --> 15:13.409 align:center line:81%
I came to my whole-souled conviction

15:14.777 --> 15:19.415 align:center line:79%
that The Church of Jesus Christ
of Latter-day Saints

15:20.783 --> 15:27.023 align:center line:79%
is a true Restoration
of the New Testament Church, and more

15:28.524 --> 15:34.263 align:center line:81%
because I could not deny the evidence

15:35.798 --> 15:37.400 align:center line:81%
of that Restoration.

15:39.235 --> 15:41.838 align:center line:81%
Since those first experiences,

15:42.505 --> 15:49.045 align:center line:79%
I suppose I’ve had a thousand,
ten thousand other witnesses

15:50.880 --> 15:54.283 align:center line:81%
of evidence that I have spoken today.

15:54.717 --> 15:57.620 align:center line:81%
All of it has been true.

15:59.589 --> 16:01.023 align:center line:81%
I'm delighted now

16:02.458 --> 16:11.200 align:center line:79%
to join my friend huddled
on the streets of Jerusalem

16:13.069 --> 16:15.338 align:center line:81%
where, with my

16:16.873 --> 16:18.741 align:center line:81%
diminished voice

16:18.741 --> 16:21.544 align:center line:81%
—and for that I apologize—

16:21.878 --> 16:25.181 align:center line:81%
nevertheless, I sing:

16:26.883 --> 16:27.884 align:center line:81%
Amazing

16:28.784 --> 16:29.785 align:center line:81%
grace—

16:31.020 --> 16:34.457 align:center line:81%
how sweet the sound—

16:35.725 --> 16:41.397 align:center line:81%
That saved a wretch like me!

16:43.766 --> 16:47.436 align:center line:81%
I once was lost,

16:48.471 --> 16:49.472 align:center line:81%
but now

16:50.573 --> 16:52.275 align:center line:81%
am found,

16:54.911 --> 16:56.145 align:center line:81%
Was blind,

16:57.213 --> 16:58.214 align:center line:81%
but now

16:59.382 --> 17:00.783 align:center line:81%
I see.

17:02.952 --> 17:06.822 align:center line:81%
In the name of Jesus Christ,

17:07.990 --> 17:08.991 align:center line:81%
amen.

